Package: cairo-qml-clock
Version: 0.2.8-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rick Appel <rappel12@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 5431
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1 (>= 3.0), libqt6core6t64 (>= 6.8.2), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.1.2), libqt6qml6 (>= 6.6.0), libstdc++6 (>= 5), libx11-6
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/rappel12/cairo-to-qml-clock
Description: A cairo-clock replacement built with Qt6 QML
 A modern reimplementation of MacSlow's cairo-clock using Qt6 QML.
 Runs on modern Linux systems without deprecated dependencies.
 Features smooth sweep second hand, multiple themes, and sticky
 workspace support.
